  {
   "body": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><head><title>Regulation (EU) 2021/821 consolidated (authored fixture text)</title></head>\n<body>\n<p>Regulation (EU) 2021/821 setting up a Union regime for the control of exports, brokering, technical assistance, transit and transfer of dual-use items (authored fixture text; not the consolidated text)</p>\n<p>ANNEX I</p>\n<p>LIST OF DUAL-USE ITEMS REFERRED TO IN ARTICLE 3</p>\n<p>CATEGORY 1 — SPECIAL MATERIALS AND RELATED EQUIPMENT</p>\n<p>1A001 Components made from fluorinated compounds, as follows:</p>\n<p>a. Seals, gaskets, sealants or fuel bladders, specially designed for fixture aircraft use.</p>\n<p>1C350 Chemicals which may be used as precursors for toxic chemical agents, as follows:</p>\n<p>1. Fixture chemical A (CAS 000-00-1);</p>\n<p>CATEGORY 5 — TELECOMMUNICATIONS AND INFORMATION SECURITY</p>\n<p>5A002 Information security systems, as follows (fixture text).</p>\n</body></html>\n",
   "headers": {
    "Content-Type": "application/xhtml+xml"
   },
   "request": "/resource/cellar/dddddddd-0000-4000-8000-000020241115.0006.03/DOC_1",
   "status": 200
  },
  {
   "body": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><head><title>Regulation (EU) 2021/821 consolidated (authored fixture text)</title></head>\n<body>\n<p>Regulation (EU) 2021/821 setting up a Union regime for the control of exports, brokering, technical assistance, transit and transfer of dual-use items (authored fixture text; not the consolidated text)</p>\n<p>ANNEX I</p>\n<p>LIST OF DUAL-USE ITEMS REFERRED TO IN ARTICLE 3</p>\n<p>CATEGORY 1 — SPECIAL MATERIALS AND RELATED EQUIPMENT</p>\n<p>1A001 Components made from fluorinated compounds, as follows:</p>\n<p>a. Seals, gaskets, sealants or fuel bladders, specially designed for fixture aircraft use.</p>\n<p>1C350 Chemicals which may be used as precursors for toxic chemical agents, as follows:</p>\n<p>1. Fixture chemical A (CAS 000-00-1);</p>\n<p>2. Fixture chemical B (CAS 000-00-2);</p>\n<p>CATEGORY 5 — TELECOMMUNICATIONS AND INFORMATION SECURITY</p>\n<p>5A002 Information security systems, as follows (fixture text).</p>\n<p>5A004 Systems, equipment and components for defeating, weakening or bypassing information security (fixture text).</p>\n</body></html>\n",
